  "next_experiment": "prove a shift-two covariance saving relative to the rough-partner selection probability, strong enough to stay below the ambient semiprime margin",
  "claim_boundary": "No Twin Prime proof and no counterexample. One exact conditional transfer identity, a rare-event no-go, and finite evidence through X=10,000,000.",
